# Intent suppression for wikihow.intent (OVOS-INTENT-2 §4.3): an utterance
# about the weather belongs to a dedicated skill and must never trigger a
# WikiHow lookup, even when it also names "wikihow". Referenced inline via
# <weather> so the weather vocabulary stays the single source of truth.
<weather>
# "ask wordnet about word" scored 0.597 for wikihow.intent (query "word")
# through "what does wikihow say about {query}", near the padatious medium
# threshold, so CI matched it on one run and not on the next. A request that
# names WordNet belongs to ovos-skill-wordnet, never to WikiHow.
wordnet
